<h2>4. Implementation</h2>

<h3>4.1 Technology Stack</h3>

<table class="data">
<tr><th>Component</th><th>Technology</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
<tr><td>Language</td><td>Python 3.10</td><td>Core development language</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hand Detection</td><td>MediaPipe Holistic</td><td>Real-time landmark extraction</td></tr>
<tr><td>ML Framework</td><td>Scikit-Learn</td><td>Random Forest classifiers</td></tr>
<tr><td>Computer Vision</td><td>OpenCV</td><td>Video capture and processing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Web Framework</td><td>Flask</td><td>Backend server</td></tr>
<tr><td>Frontend</td><td>HTML/CSS/JavaScript</td><td>Professional dark-mode UI</td></tr>
<tr><td>TTS</td><td>Google TTS (gTTS)</td><td>Text-to-speech in 4 languages</td></tr>
<tr><td>Translation</td><td>Deep Translator</td><td>Multi-language translation</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>4.2 Data Collection Pipeline</h3>

<p>Training data was collected using the built-in webcam through custom collection scripts:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Static signs:</b> 300 images per class, 37 classes = 11,100 images total. Each image was processed by MediaPipe to extract 42 hand features. After filtering incomplete detections, 3,825 valid samples were retained.</li>
<li><b>Dynamic gestures:</b> 30 sequences per class, 7 classes = 210 sequences. Each sequence consists of 30 frames (approximately 1 second of video), stored as 1,662-dimensional keypoint vectors.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.3 Web Platform</h3>

<p>The web platform consists of six pages:</p>

<table class="data">
<tr><th>Page</th><th>URL</th><th>Functionality</th></tr>
<tr><td>Home</td><td>/</td><td>Project overview, architecture stats</td></tr>
<tr><td>Learn</td><td>/learn</td><td>Dashboard with 55 lessons, progress tracking</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lesson</td><td>/learn/&lt;id&gt;</td><td>Individual lesson with camera validation</td></tr>
<tr><td>Practice</td><td>/practice</td><td>Free-form text construction</td></tr>
<tr><td>Phrase Demo</td><td>/phrase</td><td>Guided phrase demo with state machine</td></tr>
</table>

<p>The interface follows modern design principles with a dark color scheme, glassmorphism effects, smooth animations, and responsive layout. Real-time video streaming is implemented using MJPEG over HTTP.</p>

