<h3>5.3 Comparison with LSTM Approach</h3>

<p>During development, we initially implemented an LSTM-based model for dynamic gesture recognition. The comparison demonstrates the superiority of our temporal statistics approach:</p>

<table class="data">
<tr><th>Metric</th><th>LSTM Model</th><th>RF + Temporal Stats</th></tr>
