<tr><td>Real-time Stability</td><td>Poor (flickering)</td><td><b>Stable</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>Training Time</td><td>~15 minutes</td><td><b>&lt;5 seconds</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>Inference Hardware</td><td>GPU recommended</td><td><b>CPU only</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>Model Size</td><td>2.4 MB (action.h5)</td><td><b>0.4 MB</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>Framework</td><td>TensorFlow/Keras</td><td><b>Scikit-Learn</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>Data Required</td><td>Large sequences</td><td><b>30 samples/class</b></td></tr>
</table>

<p class="figure-caption">Table 3: Performance comparison between LSTM and Random Forest approaches</p>

<h3>5.4 Real-Time Performance</h3>

<p>The system runs at approximately 15-20 FPS on a laptop with Intel Core i7 processor and GTX 1650 Ti GPU (GPU not required). MediaPipe Holistic with model_complexity=0 provides the fastest landmark extraction while maintaining sufficient accuracy for classification.</p>

